     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello D-RUG folks! maptimeDavis would like to invite you to join us for a session about making maps in R!  Details are forwarded below.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Send me any questions!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Michele<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Scientist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">ORCID:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27oTg_9G--L3TXDpr3elhZ\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> geospatial Sympa List (request) &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geospatia...@lists.ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Matthew Conner<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, February 16, 2026 11:05 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geospatial Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geosp...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geospatial] #maptimeDavis: Making Maps in R<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-bottom:12.0pt\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:7.9pt;margin-left:0in;background:white\">\r\n<span><b><span style=\"color:black\">Making Maps in R</span></b></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Date: 2/20/2026</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Location: DataLab Classroom - room 360 Shields Library</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Description: In this workshop, participants will learn how to use several options for composing maps in R.</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">After completing this chapter, learners should be able to: Apply popular mapping workflows to create maps with spatial data; assess which workflow works best\r\n in different situations; apply cartographic best practices to a map composition in R</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Concepts Covered: R, Cartography, Programming, Data Vizualization</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Speaker: Michele Tobias</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Michele Tobias is a geospatial data scientist with a background in geospatial methods for ecology. Michele earned her PhD from UC Davis in Geography where\r\n she studied California’s sandy beach ecosystem with traditional phytosociological methods and innovative remote sensing tools and was a postdoc at the UC Davis Information Center for the Environment. In her current position as a geospatial data scientist at\r\n UC Davis DataLab, she applies geospatial tools to new avenues of research across disciplines.</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Prerequisites: For the best experience, we recommend learners have the following skills before taking this workshop: an introductory understanding of programming\r\n in R (for example, you are familiar with how to load libraries, load common data formats like a CSV, and are comfortable running basic commands). See DataLab’s\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"color:#18bc9c\"><a href=\"https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_r_basics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_r_basics/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2mEQKj3CNgHdMsgWTBJ3eq\"><span style=\"color:#18bc9c\">R Basics Workshop</span></a></span></span><span><span style=\"color:black\"> for\r\n help; an introductory understanding of spatial data (for example, you are familiar with the difference between raster and vector data). See DataLab’s ,a href=&quot;<a href=\"https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_spatial_data_formats/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_spatial_data_formats/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XCOm_GAw-aoetr3bj-BW5\">https://ucdavisdatalab.github.io/workshop_spatial_data_formats/</a>&quot;&gt;Spatial\r\n Data Formats Workshop&lt;/a&gt; for help; (recommended) review the concepts (first section) of DataLab’s Cartography for Academic Publications Workshop</span></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Software Required: To fully participate in this workshop, learners should download and install R and RStudio on their laptop before the workshop begins<b>.</b></span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span><b><span style=\"color:#18bc9c\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/making-maps-in-r-tickets-1977401965509?aff=oddtdtcreator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/making-maps-in-r-tickets-1977401965509?aff%3Doddtdtcreator&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3BGB59RSJpmUL7RDL8iUBr\"><span style=\"color:#18bc9c\">RSVP</span></a></span></b></span><span style=\"color:#18bc9c\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">Whenever possible, #maptimeDavis Workshops will be recorded and posted on the\r\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/@maptimedavis95616&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Et6iVw04Vg5ApeFqFYSkC\">\r\n#maptimeDavis YouTube channel</a>. #maptimeDavis Studio will not be recorded to encourage open discussion. Weekly reminders will be sent on the\r\n<a href=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" title=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ua_egN4MjO89UGBNH2dqS\">\r\nGeospatial Email List</a>.</span></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span><span style=\"color:black\">#maptimeDavis Workshops and Studio are a product of UC Davis DataLab’s\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" title=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464278691000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0k4iEeAQG8OYPNkY9rEoAD\">\r\nSpatial Sciences Research Cluster</a> and are supported by the contributions and participation of our community. Please send questions to Michele Tobias\r\n<a href title=\"mailto:mmt...@ucdavis.edu\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a></span></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in;background:white\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in;background:white\">\r\n<span><span style=\"color:black\">Matt Conner</span></span><span style=\"color:black\"><br>\r\n<span>Student Services Department</span><br>\r\n<span>Library</span><br>\r\n<span>University of California, Davis</span><br>\r\n<span>on behalf of the #maptimeDavis council</span></span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
